content = """# ClawPilot Heartbeat Checklist

## Purpose
A minimal, focused routine to ensure nothing urgent is missed and no blockers grow stale. Run at scheduled intervals or on-demand when context shifts.

---

## Heartbeat Checklist

### 1. Urgent Tasks Scan
- [ ] Check Telegram for @mentions in operations channels
- [ ] Check Discord for @mentions in project servers
- [ ] Review any messages marked as "urgent" or "ASAP"
- [ ] Identify tasks due within the next 4 hours

### 2. Stale Blocker Check
- [ ] List all tasks blocked > 12 hours
- [ ] List all tasks blocked > 24 hours
- [ ] Identify which blockers need escalation
- [ ] Confirm no critical path items are stalled

### 3. Pending Drafts
- [ ] Review any drafted messages awaiting confirmation
- [ ] Identify drafts older than 4 hours (may need refresh)
- [ ] Flag any time-sensitive drafts

### 4. Cross-Platform Sync
- [ ] Verify no duplicate tasks across Telegram/Discord
- [ ] Check for conflicting information between platforms
- [ ] Ensure task owners are correctly identified

### 5. Memory State
- [ ] Confirm MEMORY.md is up to date
- [ ] Verify today's memory file exists under memory/
- [ ] Check for any preferences that need updating

---

## Scheduled Heartbeat Times (SGT)

| Time | Focus |
|------|-------|
| 08:00 | Morning briefing: overnight items, today's priorities |
| 14:00 | Midday check: progress review, afternoon blockers |
| 18:00 | End-of-day summary: wrap-up, handoff notes |

---

## Heartbeat Output Format

Example output:

[Heartbeat Check - 2026-04-14 08:00 SGT]

URGENT:
- Deployment review scheduled for 14:00
- API integration awaiting QA signoff

BLOCKERS (>24h):
- Database migration script -> Owner: @devops
- Payment gateway config -> Owner: @backend

PENDING DRAFTS:
- Status update for #operations

STATUS: Attention needed
— ClawPilot

---

## Escalation Triggers

Escalate to Mira immediately if:
- Critical path task blocked > 24 hours
- Urgent message from external stakeholder
- Deployment window approaching with unresolved blockers
- Any security or access-related concern

---
*Heartbeat version: 1.0 | Last updated: 2026-04-14*
"""

